@startuml ac_uc_3_4_data_freshness

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  DiamondBackgroundColor #BBDEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #1565C0
}

title <size:18><b>UC-3.4 — View Data Freshness</b></size>\nActivity Diagram

|Actor|
start
:Navigate to\nSystem Health page;

|System|
if (Freshness data\navailable?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Display indicator:\ndata freshness unavailable;
  stop
endif

:Query BigQuery for\nanalytical data freshness indicators;

:Display data freshness;
note right
  Indicators:
  - Most recent analytical date
  - Current relative to ETL schedule?
  - Recent ETL populated product?
  - Significant channel-processing
    failures?
end note

|Actor|
:Review data freshness\nto determine if analytical\ndata product is current;
stop

@enduml
